sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client App
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant Billing as Billing Service
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Data as Warehouse

    Client->>Gateway: Submit export request with destination settings, encryption policy, retention rules, and notification preferences
    Gateway->>Policy: Evaluate export permission, data sensitivity policy, and regional routing requirements
    alt Export blocked by policy
        Policy-->>Gateway: Return denial reason, remediation hint, and audit reference
        Gateway-->>Client: Return validation error with actionable policy feedback
    else Export allowed
        Policy-->>Gateway: Return approved export policy and execution constraints
        Gateway->>Billing: Validate plan entitlement and export quota before scheduling the job
        Billing-->>Gateway: Return usage allowance and feature gating decision
        par Schedule export
            Gateway->>Queue: Enqueue export job with approved policy, destination bundle, and execution constraints
            Queue-->>Worker: Dispatch export preparation task to worker pool
        and Prepare storage
            Gateway->>Data: Reserve export snapshot and downstream delivery metadata for the requested dataset bundle
            Data-->>Gateway: Return export snapshot id and readiness confirmation
        end
        Worker-->>Client: Stream export started acknowledgement for the original request context
    end
